{"version":1,"content":"<p>模塊化電腦製造商Framework推出的Wireless Touchpad Keyboard無線觸控鍵盤現已正式開放預訂。這款產品主打客廳和沙發場景，希望為用户提供比羅技經典K400更好的無線鍵盤體驗，同時兼顧桌面電腦、電視、遊戲主機及其他設備的操控需求。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586838.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T21:00:38.636941+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T20:37:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T20:53:53.290522+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T20:53:53.290522+00:00","content_hash":"cc818ff293e2e9acf9cf1a43485388f1b2e93d77554d34b6a75b80d8cd28f4f9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}